  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Driving NDC Progress through Solar Energy and WASH Innovations:  Empowering Vulnerable Rural Communities in Southern Belize (NDC-SOLAR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">This project aims to demonstrate how strategic investments can significantly advance the reduction of greenhouse gas emissions and improve essential needs for vulnerable populations, thereby supporting sustainable development goals (SDGs). Furthermore, the project will identify key opportunities for scaling these initiatives to maximize their impact and to inform the revision process of Belizes Nationally Determined Contributions (NDCs). This will be done by solarising WASH (Water, Sanitation,</narrative>
  </description>
